From 73c93570c5ab9ab9d60094dc75a8f3930d23b62d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:34:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): keep preview-mirror parks across Single refill
 [daveey]

Single's remove/release cleared $parkedTreePanes for every displaced main tab.
A preview pane-mirror can also park the same id (hidden-session Browser). Dropping
Single's claim then let adopt dock that Browser beside a different focused chat.

Parking is now per-owner. Single refill/release skip panes another owner still
holds. Preview-only zones keep their strip and extra Browser tabs so "+" and
chips still work (session slot stays Single).

Proof: RED on watchPreviewTiles (tile-a Browser docked beside tile-b after
registry change); Auto control stayed clean. GREEN after owner claims. 74
focused vitest + tsc + scripts/check 21.
